====Usage notes====
* The stressed variant is found in the following situations:
*# the past participle of verbs with a one-syllable root ending in {{lang|ru|-ать}}: e.g. {{m|ru|до́сланный}} from {{m|ru|досла́ть}}, {{m|ru|до́рванный}} from {{m|ru|дорва́ть}};
*# some deverbal nouns: e.g. {{m|ru|до́говор||[[contract]], [[agreement]], [[treaty]]}} from {{m|ru|договори́ться||to [[agree]]}}, {{m|ru|до́мысел||[[guesswork]], [[speculation]]}} from {{m|ru|домы́слить}}, {{m|ru|до́пуск||[[access]], [[admittance]]}} from {{m|ru|допуска́ть||to [[admit]]}};
*# some adverbs.

